.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-PROJECT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-project \- Project the graph and run a graph algorithm such as PageRank
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu project\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-algorithm\fR] [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-predicate\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-damping\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-iters\fR] [\fB\-\-tolerance\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-\-seed\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Project the graph and run a graph algorithm such as PageRank
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-algorithm\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Graph projection algorithm
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Entity type IRI to select
.TP
\fB\-\-predicate\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Predicate IRI used to filter facts or edges
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Explicit graph IRI for this operation
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Maximum number of results
.TP
\fB\-\-damping\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
PageRank damping factor
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-iters\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Maximum algorithm iterations
.TP
\fB\-\-tolerance\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Convergence tolerance for the algorithm
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Start entity IRI for shortest\-path projection
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Destination entity IRI for shortest\-path projection
.TP
\fB\-\-seed\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Seed entity for graph projection
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
